<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prentiss a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prentiss a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Prentiss Properties Trust with a strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 21-5/8 in early NYSE trade.</p>
